set.body:
Freeze the mathematical and lifecycle contracts before adding APIs.

Define separately:
- full score projection X W;
- partial contribution X_S W_S;
- partial least-squares recovery X_S W_S (W_S* Q_S W_S + lambda I)^-1;
- supplementary-variable projection against the fitted training score space;
- synthesis, partial reconstruction, and paired transfer.

Port small multivarious fixtures for project, partial_project, partial_projector, project_vars, project_block, reconstruction, and transfer, and add generalized-metric dense oracles.

Acceptance:
- each operation has a named result contract, dimensional law, and provenance rule;
- contribution and least-squares recovery cannot be confused by a Boolean flag;
- row identity, feature identity, centering, scaling, null-spectrum, and rank-deficiency policies are explicit;
- fixture generation is reproducible and JVM/Scala.js tests consume the same fixtures.
